XML Parser: the event-based xml_parser functions, on libxml2 of the
package az.

The module xml of PHP 7.4 for php74 of azsupport/ports, which installs
side by side with the other versions of PHP: lib/php/20190902/xml.so,
loaded by its ini in etc/php74/conf.d, its headers in
include/php74/php/ext/xml.
